[gd_scene load_steps=34 format=3]

; M3-BPR-03: the burning Saltwright salvage camp (Ch6 B04: ch06_inquisitor, by the burning hulk, 15:40), greybox
; until env-art's Brine Shoals kit lands (M3-ENV-02). The Ch6 grade (color_script.md "Ch6"): sun 35 deg, key #FFD5B3
; 2.4, fill #A8B8B0 0.55, rim #E0702E 0.7, sky #7FA3C0 / #D8C8A8, fog #B8A890, exposure 0.70, saturation x0.9;
; silted_flats water (deep #4A5A50) at the waterline; the fire's light is steady orange points (no flicker, no
; flash). The camp's mud bank, flat at y = 0 around the fighters; behind the foes the hulk the party hid in, burning
; low along its gunwale, lashed hulls, a tide-wheel and lamp racks alight; dark smoke columns rise far behind.
; Nobody dies in this fight, and the staging stays sober: no embers, nothing falling.

